# log history
# 10.2025 correct the typo in swapping k0 and k_inf for R1131 CH2CN + H + M -> CH3CN + M
# 2025.6. added H2CS mechanism that produces enough CS2
# added CH3C2H (propyne), CH2CCH2 (allene), C3H5, C3H6 (photolysis of C3H3, C3H5, C3H6)
